      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "In addition, eye tracking will allow the system to determine which object the player is looking at and simulate the depth of field, making more distant and closer objects blurry. Also, eye tracking will allow the system to create a stereoscopic image not in parallel-way, but in a cross-way, which is more natural for a humans.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
