      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The Vive Pro Eye is like at least 1400 euro, I don't think the development time implementing the tech would be worth it seeing how few people actually own the headset and actually uses it for VRchat.\nWhen a consumer friendly eye-tracking tech is out on the market then I think it makes sense implementing actual eyetracking.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
