      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{58c6b8f8227a56787575ebc0|full_name}: its a thousand dollars alone true pretty Pricey.\nSo Far LA Noir vr Version has it plus Neos and Virtual Cast so Support is slowly coming. \nIf vrchat and other devs start supporting it then the mainstream HMDs will start looking into having a add on or something to make it common.\n \nFoveated Render will reduce Power needed so more complex scenes in games and better DoF etc...\nHopefully they Look into it and start implementing it",
